  "notable_quotes": [
    "CO2-selective recovery is challenging because CO2 differs by <0.2 Å from other gases and is present at only ~5 kPa partial pressure.",
    "CUPMOF-5 shows benchmark CO2/Xe, CO2/N2, and CO2/O2 selectivities, several orders of magnitude higher than NbOFFIVE-1-Ni.",
